thousands of dollars actual inference out of those subscriptions.

85
00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:25.480
So as the end user, you're not necessarily thinking about the dollar amount.

86
00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:29.200
When you're prompting all these agents, you kind of feel like

87
